direction: right
Clients: Chat clients {shape: person}
LoadBalancer: Load balancer {shape: hexagon}
WebSocket: WebSocket servers {shape: rectangle}
Presence: Presence service {shape: rectangle}
Broker: Message broker {shape: queue}
Fanout: Fan-out workers {shape: rectangle}
Messages: Message store {shape: cylinder}
Cache: Session cache {shape: stored_data}
Clients -> LoadBalancer: WebSocket
LoadBalancer -> WebSocket
WebSocket -> Presence: online state
WebSocket -> Broker: publish
Broker -> Fanout: consume
Fanout -> WebSocket: deliver
Fanout -> Messages: persist
Presence -> Cache
